  {
    "id": "1887666811447202131",
    "created_at": "2025-02-06 19:56:53 -05:00",
    "full_text": "Of course people foresaw staking being abstracted into a token before launch, come on. It had been on bankless as an ‘internet bond’ by then. I was trying to make improvements on lsts in Dec. 2020. Lido was like the third attempt at an LST by a month post genesis. People knew there would be LSTs.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZrjHaLgUmV\n\nhttps://t.co/IUXRL6gZDT \n\nThe decision on the ratio question was to pick a smooth curve towards a real rate of zero at 100% and let it find equilibrium, caps below that rate allow for discouragement attacks. Most of the agonising was on the low end tbh.",
    "media": [],
    "screen_name": "OisinKyne",
    "name": "oisin.eth | Obol",
